ared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","review_id":"ilrpmECxSpi_zfXm95iZUg","date":"2015-05-09T02:34:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9411967992782593,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in for dinner with some friends last night and I'm not sorry we did! I've definitely overlooked this little restaurant in the past along a busy shopping area of Magazine. We ended up sharing smaller plates for dinner, almost like tapas style. Honestly, there was more than enough food without us ordering any entrees (total for food plus $18 of drinks was $65 after tax). The service was the right tempo for an enjoyable meal (not too fast and not too slow). Our server was quirky and kept the conversation light. The overall ambiance was great and there was a steady slow of people while we were there. Food-wise: - Guacamole $8 with many choices. We went with artichoke, which was good -..."},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","review_id":"gv_1-A6wVFqAkNfRIjtAFQ","date":"2012-06-21T22:48:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364629983901978,"text_excerpt":"I loved dinner at Maya's. We walked down on a weeknight, unsure of where we'd go. We had heard that Maya's has the best mojito in town, but we were put off by the price. Considering we make mojitos at home often, paying $11 was a little steep. We were offered a chance to look at their Facebook page to find the drink specials, which are available after clicking \"like.\" I'm not a big fan of that idea (C'mon, why not a Yelp special?), so we opted for the reasonable $5 margaritas and sangrias. We were very happy with both drinks. On to food: simply outstanding. My expectations were not particularly high as I knew nothing about the food coming in. The prices were a little off-putting, and the ..."},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","review_id":"_zcoGw50M2MgIG1FzFrceg","date":"2015-12-31T06:04:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9363948106765747,"text_excerpt":"I have been here two times and the food was amazing! Any appetizer with seafood is a hit, especially the mango crab avocado stack. The Ceviche is a great dish as well. The first time I went, I ordered coconut curry shrimp with rice. There's an option to have yellow or red curry (I selected red because I wanted it to be spicy). This time I selected the Brazilian Moqueca with shrimp. Both of these dishes were equally amazing! The Brazilian Moqueca came out on a sizzling hot pan mixed with veggies and shrimp. I also tasted the Caribbean fish. Either of these 3 are great selections. Make sure you feel comfortable with your waiter/waitress so you can ask for additional recommendations."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","photo_id":"dah_jLjAX0fL7x1j-FyihQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dah_jLjAX0fL7x1j-FyihQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8517208695411682},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","photo_id":"URkGUPOmXcjgLEwm50sVmw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/URkGUPOmXcjgLEwm50sVmw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.842028021812439},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","photo_id":"aatCt5kzPK_H7GcHXpyg4w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aatCt5kzPK_H7GcHXpyg4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8109513521194458},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","photo_id":"KO-ZWnI_ho-wQJkFhv1IDQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/KO-ZWnI_ho-wQJkFhv1IDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.743518590927124},{"business_id":"3nYIq4THGUOgQCAF-mkd7w","photo_id":"pOKTaMvzLKukUOyhzkIBCA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pOKTaMvzLKukUOyhzkIBCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7329436540603638}]},"notebook_case":null}
